        "chars": 123,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 88.62
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        128,
        1194,
        1905,
        1274
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, the development and growth of the City can and should be reconciled with the improvement of our urban environment;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2067,
          "min": -1.4665
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 24,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0045
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1983,
        "area_px": 132354,
        "density": 0.01498,
        "chars": 123,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 62.03
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        128,
        1312,
        1953,
        1432
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, it is the continuing policy of the City that environmental factors be considered before governmental approval is given to proposed activities that may significantly affect our urban environment;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1887,
          "min": -1.3703
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 32,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0009
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 3819,
        "area_px": 197714,
        "density": 0.01932,
        "chars": 203,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 53.16
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        128,
        1470,
        1953,
        1668
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, it is essential to the implementation of this policy that the Mayor or his designated representative be informed of the environmental consequences of proposed activities which require the approval of the government of the City of New York and any alternatives by which any adverse environmental consequences could be reduced or eliminated; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1274,
          "min": -1.0145
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 57,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0024
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5678,
