    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        128,
        1709,
        1953,
        1869
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, the establishment of specific procedures for the comprehensive review by the Environmental Protection Administration of the environmental consequences of proposed activities will help to ensure that environmental factors are adequately and timely considered;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
